            <span class="legal-section-num">06</span>
            <span class="legal-section-title">Your Rights</span>
          </div>
          <p>Depending on your jurisdiction, you may have the right to access, correct, delete, or restrict the processing of your personal data. To exercise any of these rights, contact us at <strong>hello@insertai.com</strong>.</p>
