            <span class="legal-section-num">02</span>
            <span class="legal-section-title">Book a Strategy Session</span>
          </div>
          <p>Schedule a <strong>free 30-minute strategy session</strong> with our team. During this call, we:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Understand your business, goals, and current tech stack</li>
            <li>Identify the highest-impact opportunity for AI or automation</li>
            <li>Assess technical feasibility and timeline</li>
            <li>Answer any questions about our process, pricing, or capabilities</li>
          </ul>
          <p>No sales pressure — this is a genuine technical consultation to determine if we're the right fit.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="legal-section">
          <div class="legal-section-header">
            <span class="legal-section-num">03</span>
            <span class="legal-section-title">Discovery &amp; Scoping</span>
          </div>
